              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Most Popular Viewpoints on Koh Tao",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "If you have limited time on the island, then these are the viewpoints you should prioritize. Countless marketing campaigns, hundreds of postcards, and thousands of social media profile pictures originate from these three spectacular Koh Tao viewpoints.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Remote Viewpoints",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "If you don’t mind a steep drive or a bit of hiking, then you’ll be rewarded with unspoiled vistas and minimal other traffic. Some of these Koh Tao viewpoints are just rocky outcroppings or mountain ledges jutting out from the jungle – so the chances of having to share with many other visitors is minimal.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Viewpoints with Bars",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Sweating it out on a jungle hike isn’t for everyone. So if you prefer to simply drive to each viewpoint, snap some shots for Instagram, grab a refreshing beer, and head off again, then these are the best options for you:",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      }
    ],
